  "console": {
    "$comment": "FreeMixer/openmixer integration/waves-2026-10 has no channel-strip stage: its strip is the trim, the EQ (with the HPF and LPF), the gate and the dynamics stages themselves. Racked as a plugin (the insert rack's kinds, channel-contract.ts INSERT_RACK_KINDS) it is drawn by the generic plugin editor.",
